@startuml
title Log out: you start again, nameless
actor "Dee" as dee
participant "Chat" as app
actor "Ada, Bob (have room:general open)" as room

dee -> app : remove session
app --> dee : close room:general
app --> dee : close lobby
app --> dee : close session
group derived again: a patch goes only where a value changed
  app -> room : patch room:general remove /members/Dee
  note over room : only if Dee has no other connected session in general;\nthe lobby does not change: Ada and Bob are still in it
end
app --> dee : open session
note right of dee : a fresh session on this device, nameless;\nDee's other devices are untouched
note over dee : not on the ledger: logging out is not undone
@enduml
